{
  "id": "c1-e08-is-university-worth-it",
  "level": "C1",
  "version": 1,
  "topic": "Is university worth it?",
  "parts": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "title": "Interview",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p1-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Good evening. First of all, we'd like to know a little about you.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e08-is-university-worth-it/p1-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4400
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q1",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "text": "Candidate A, what motivated you to choose your field of study or work?",
          "durationSec": 25,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e08-is-university-worth-it/p1-q1.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5200
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q2",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "text": "Candidate B, do you think a degree guarantees a good job?",
          "durationSec": 25,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e08-is-university-worth-it/p1-q2.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4400
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q3",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "text": "Candidate A, what skills do you feel you will need most in the future?",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e08-is-university-worth-it/p1-q3.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5100
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q4",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "text": "Candidate B, how important is it to you to keep learning throughout your life?",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e08-is-university-worth-it/p1-q4.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5400
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "title": "Long turn",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p2-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "In this part of the test, I'm going to give each of you three pictures. I'd like you to talk about two of them on your own for about a minute, and also to answer a question briefly about your partner's pictures.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e08-is-university-worth-it/p2-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 13200
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-a",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "assets": [
            "c1-e08-a1",
            "c1-e08-a2",
            "c1-e08-a3"
          ],
          "text": "Candidate A, your pictures show people gaining qualifications or skills. Choose two of the pictures and say what the people might be hoping to achieve, and how satisfied they might be afterwards.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e08-is-university-worth-it/p2-a.mp3",
          "audioMs": 13200
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-a-follow",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "text": "Candidate B, which of these routes do you think offers the best preparation for working life?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e08-is-university-worth-it/p2-a-follow.mp3",
          "audioMs": 6300
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-b",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "assets": [
            "c1-e08-b1",
            "c1-e08-b2",
            "c1-e08-b3"
          ],
          "text": "Candidate B, your pictures show people learning in different ways. Choose two of the pictures and say what motivates the people to learn, and what difficulties they might face.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e08-is-university-worth-it/p2-b.mp3",
          "audioMs": 11500
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-b-follow",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "text": "Candidate A, do you think it is ever too late to go back to education?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e08-is-university-worth-it/p2-b-follow.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5000
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "title": "Collaborative task",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p3-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Now I'd like you to talk about something together for about two minutes. Here are some reasons people give for going to university, and a question for you to discuss.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e08-is-university-worth-it/p3-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 10600
        },
        {
          "id": "p3-discuss",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 120,
          "diagram": "c1-e08-is-university-worth-it",
          "text": "Talk to each other about this question: How might these reasons influence a young person's decision to go to university?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e08-is-university-worth-it/p3-discuss.mp3",
          "audioMs": 8900
        },
        {
          "id": "p3-decide",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "diagram": "c1-e08-is-university-worth-it",
          "text": "Now you have about a minute to decide together. Which is the most convincing reason?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e08-is-university-worth-it/p3-decide.mp3",
          "audioMs": 6000
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "title": "Discussion",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p4-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Now I'd like to ask you some more questions about the value of higher education.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e08-is-university-worth-it/p4-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 6100
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q1",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 50,
          "text": "Is a university education still the best route to a successful career?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e08-is-university-worth-it/p4-q1.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5300
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q2",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate A, should higher education be free for everyone who wants it?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e08-is-university-worth-it/p4-q2.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5100
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q3",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate B, to what extent should universities prepare students for the world of work?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e08-is-university-worth-it/p4-q3.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5900
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q4",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 50,
          "text": "Do you think too many young people go to university?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e08-is-university-worth-it/p4-q4.mp3",
          "audioMs": 3800
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q5",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate A, how might online learning change the way degrees are taught?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e08-is-university-worth-it/p4-q5.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5200
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q6",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate B, is practical experience more valuable than academic knowledge?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e08-is-university-worth-it/p4-q6.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5800
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
